pi-personal
===========

This project is a copy and second development layer on top of pi
(https://github.com/earendil-works/pi), pinned at upstream commit 136b87e,
both MIT licensed. The upstream copyright and license are retained in LICENSE.

The upstream runtime packages under packages/ (durable, ai, agent, chord,
codemode, env, evals, mcp, telemetry, tui, coding-agent) are unmodified pi
code and belong to their upstream authors.

The personal layer added by this fork lives in packages/personal-agent
(and, from M5 on, apps/personal-web).
